data: {"id": "f5c7d4597893461f-thinking-parallel_evidence-2075", "run_id": "f5c7d4597893461f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在我已经掌握了全部关键事实：\n\n**证据结论：**\n\n### 已确认事实\n1. **Pod 状态确认为 Pending**：`kube_pod_status_phase` 值为 1 (Pending)，与上游 handoff 一致。\n2. **Pod UID 一致**：`78de30b1-06ec-4314-9120-26d93c29a48a`，身份无漂移。\n3. **调度失败原因确认为节点选择器不匹配**：`kubectl_describe` 和 `kubectl_events` 均返回 `FailedScheduling` 事件，原文为 **\"0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector\"**。\n4. **Pod 的 NodeSelector 要求**：`aiops.lab/unavailable=true`（来自 YAML）。\n5. **集群所有 3 个节点 (master, node1, node2) 均未设置 `aiops.lab/unavailable` 标签**，", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788762624524, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

